{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"98f4dd90365929cb","type":"group","x":2080,"y":2290,"width":5680,"height":2480,"color":"5","label":"微分算子法"},
		{"id":"2116dabbb42ca498","type":"group","x":-1840,"y":1880,"width":1500,"height":1740,"color":"1","label":"题型整理"},
		{"id":"5bdb959bc9a28975","type":"group","x":-160,"y":2080,"width":1520,"height":1040,"color":"4","label":"两种特殊的方程"},
		{"id":"22be973deeb8f879","type":"group","x":3040,"y":3450,"width":1300,"height":910,"label":"第二类：单三角"},
		{"id":"e97d4124d5e4d75d","type":"group","x":2580,"y":-1120,"width":1300,"height":640,"label":"注意点"},
		{"id":"42e71937ae8d1e37","type":"group","x":-3520,"y":1020,"width":1040,"height":680,"color":"6","label":"注意点"},
		{"id":"6ff69da0cffabc67","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260427_201146.jpg","x":-1794,"y":677,"width":844,"height":513},
		{"id":"1d19cc007da0fe4d","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260427_201551.jpg","x":-1800,"y":1368,"width":856,"height":214},
		{
			"id":"760eeec74960c0dc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"一阶微分方程",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-950,
			"y":-300,
			"width":295,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"9bd482ae6dff9fd5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"若是一阶线性齐次（$q(x) = 0$），则：\n\n$$\n通解为: y = Ce^{-\\int P(x)dx}\n$$",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-820,
			"y":844,
			"width":340,
			"height":180
		},
		{"id":"2e76d3aa521ca558","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260720211243.png","x":-944,"y":1368,"width":773,"height":215},
		{"id":"4474edc2399ee384","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260427_223523.jpg","x":-570,"y":551,"width":400,"height":97},
		{"id":"2668ffbaf5898d5e","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260720174734.png","x":-1800,"y":1582,"width":798,"height":102},
		{"id":"9d73124d6715bd1f","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260721073123.png","x":-861,"y":1720,"width":607,"height":60},
		{"id":"c722cfe65809b1ea","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428144549.png","x":-1725,"y":348,"width":774,"height":182},
		{
			"id":"183e9f1c0ba378ec",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(3) 线性",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1456,
			"y":90,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"be20527fb45440f7","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260503161716.png","x":-1290,"y":2601,"width":300,"height":197},
		{"id":"0f9048397c3067cd","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260719070950.png","x":-1240,"y":2800,"width":400,"height":365},
		{"id":"9a7a329fe176d0af","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260503_161631.jpg","x":-1760,"y":2740,"width":398,"height":45},
		{
			"id":"e447e8f6c015bfe7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(5) 一部分求导等于另一部分，需要顶级观察力，也是我目前认为微分方程最难的一类题目",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1811,
			"y":2933,
			"width":500,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"4007725e2e4bd01f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(1) dy 前面的系数不好分离，**考虑 $x, y$ 地位等价**，整体变成：\n\n$$\n\\frac {{\\text d}x}{{\\text d}y}\n$$",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1780,
			"y":1960,
			"width":500,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"0bee916682fb2bfe",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(2) 包含变限积分的形式\n\n1. 若 $f(x)$ 可导，整理后，直接两边求导，消去变限积分形式，从而变成普通微分方程\n2. 若 $f(x)$ 不可导，**一定会有 $f(x)$ 连续的条件**，考虑**连续函数必有原函数**定理，变限积分求导就是原函数，令变限积分为 $g(x)$，消去原方程的变限积分形式\n\n",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1780,
			"y":2140,
			"width":490,
			"height":260
		},
		{
			"id":"071f786ae56f7a24",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(3) 给求常数 $C_i$ 的条件：\n\n1. 给具体的点\n2. 给极限",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1780,
			"y":2400,
			"width":500,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"f13297e4b9bffd21",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(4) 和敛散性结合一起，比如求通解的广义积分，微分方程经常带 $e^{kx}$ 项，由于通项趋于 $0$，必然有 $k < 0$，对应到特征方程的根的情况。**最后通过题目给的微分方程构造等式**",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1790,
			"y":2600,
			"width":500,
			"height":200
		},
		{"id":"5bf7978ef99b210e","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260430041625.png","x":-2900,"y":1054,"width":309,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"275dc06d2f56feee",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(1) 只要给出微分方程的表达式，$f(x)$ 就无限阶可导",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-3480,
			"y":1224,
			"width":430,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c54b02e35f31db5f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(2) 题目给出的非齐解**一般是与齐次解的线性组合混合起来的解**，因此可以通过减去非齐解得到非齐解的最简形式，从而使得求导简单",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3480,
			"y":1520,
			"width":430,
			"height":120
		},
		{"id":"4037da15a4e78259","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428144429.png","x":-2600,"y":343,"width":550,"height":126},
		{
			"id":"af07ec5066f94b7b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(2) 齐次",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-2455,
			"y":111,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"7e1b356c72d10ba6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(1) 可分离变量",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-3390,
			"y":49,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"aedc4661c0c2b672",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"常见齐次式：\n\n1. $\\ln y - \\ln x = \\ln \\dfrac yx$",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-2472,
			"y":500,
			"width":295,
			"height":210
		},
		{"id":"8b880c112d1673a4","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428144408.png","x":-3260,"y":359,"width":522,"height":105},
		{"id":"febcf920e3e62309","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428144355.png","x":-3840,"y":349,"width":544,"height":115},
		{"id":"559373edcfeadd7a","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428145208.png","x":3654,"y":985,"width":500,"height":235},
		{"id":"95ebc76eb902da81","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/result_KvJJ1R.png","x":3654,"y":1221,"width":499,"height":173},
		{"id":"db04a6cd380d295f","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428145406.png","x":4155,"y":988,"width":500,"height":231},
		{"id":"585cfe25ebed0b00","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260502032410.png","x":3778,"y":3577,"width":476,"height":504},
		{
			"id":"a2adaa3cbe254abd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"不含三角\n\n1. 指数照抄\n2. 多项式次数相同\n3. 乘幂函数 $k = 0, 1, 2$ ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":4760,
			"y":1000,
			"width":320,
			"height":208
		},
		{"id":"93c4ed69d59d4ef0","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260428_004652.jpg","x":5351,"y":2450,"width":621,"height":581},
		{"id":"cc2e92e39d97bf5a","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260502031715.png","x":5972,"y":3337,"width":800,"height":466},
		{"id":"9c9f53b3440f47ec","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428145612.png","x":3667,"y":1595,"width":473,"height":175},
		{"id":"f0a95c6c732f9385","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260719072941.png","x":3667,"y":1770,"width":474,"height":283},
		{"id":"77739f10731a274d","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428145425.png","x":4155,"y":1221,"width":475,"height":226},
		{
			"id":"822230a4a1e57f8f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"含三角\n\n1. 指数照抄\n2. 多项式取最高次\n3. 乘幂函数 $k = 0, 1$ ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":4720,
			"y":1239,
			"width":360,
			"height":208
		},
		{
			"id":"86a9c6e31e6b23a7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"齐次",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":2441,
			"y":323,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"76b636f0d1b63aa9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"若是变系数，则其根的结构没有任何规律，可能出现任何常系数根的所有组合\n\n有非常多的**模拟题**会考到变系数方程，需要注意不能使用常系数的公式",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":5490,
			"y":359,
			"width":410,
			"height":183
		},
		{"id":"5e7bf0ed2eccde44","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428160007.png","x":5000,"y":279,"width":400,"height":272},
		{"id":"2dd1d27e523ccb1a","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260719073006.png","x":3204,"y":985,"width":450,"height":370},
		{"id":"3a64f4e352284707","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/result_JNyye2.png","x":2310,"y":995,"width":500,"height":230},
		{"id":"fe901d258d62d84c","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260719073258.png","x":1640,"y":1009,"width":270,"height":400},
		{"id":"fea00b1c64488e21","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260430_220145.jpg","x":2210,"y":1557,"width":679,"height":58},
		{"id":"afd1aa9a9db70662","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428145042.png","x":2310,"y":1227,"width":500,"height":160},
		{"id":"1aab39ca941d82d9","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260719073306.png","x":1910,"y":1009,"width":399,"height":218},
		{
			"id":"2cb6622253e1b363",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"⭐对于任何阶数的**常系数线性齐次常微分方程**，都可以使用特征方程 + 解的叠加原理求解",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":2111,
			"y":1491,
			"width":877,
			"height":66
		},
		{"id":"8b31fe456e18b5c1","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260427_223551.jpg","x":-130,"y":567,"width":399,"height":219},
		{"id":"b649051322ad6307","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260427_223605.jpg","x":350,"y":567,"width":450,"height":64},
		{
			"id":"0e424de6d69048ab",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"转化之后统一使用**一阶线性微分方程**的**公式**求解",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":320,
			"y":267,
			"width":540,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"4d3365f75ec44178",
			"type":"text",
			"text":" (4) 二阶可降阶",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-70,
			"y":267,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"4e2b467f09a01509","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428144812.png","x":2321,"y":496,"width":495,"height":62},
		{"id":"2dd4143306a73b13","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428144834.png","x":2321,"y":558,"width":489,"height":107},
		{
			"id":"d0ad8bb24b184aa5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"非齐次",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":3774,
			"y":365,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"29d2c1e03c46c325","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428144800.png","x":3679,"y":605,"width":465,"height":62},
		{"id":"4ea64d6d66c2c7cd","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428145122.png","x":3679,"y":667,"width":475,"height":96},
		{
			"id":"9280e7fe87d2bc36",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"高阶微分方程",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":3517,
			"y":-160,
			"width":300,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"32521ec2034bf1bc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"二阶常系数线性",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":3107,
			"y":74,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"8873c730caf91037",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"解的结构",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":5270,
			"y":79,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"01a63dd0b9afaf79",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"通解中本质独立的任意常数个数 = 微分方程的阶数",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":2700,
			"y":-1040,
			"width":280,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"789a705914df208c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. 线性（不能出现平方）\n2. ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":3160,
			"y":-660,
			"width":280,
			"height":90
		},
		{
			"id":"3ccddcc14560e3ff",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"两种特殊方程\n\n一阶：**伯努利方程**\n高阶：**欧拉方程**",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":360,
			"y":2140,
			"width":420,
			"height":200
		},
		{"id":"8ea57796d73bb3da","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260428_011330.jpg","x":650,"y":2500,"width":598,"height":386},
		{"id":"f319dfa7d4bb0341","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260427_215233.jpg","x":-110,"y":2540,"width":645,"height":263},
		{
			"id":"14428e11e8cf8f51",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"多少次导数前面跟对应相等的 $x$ 的多少次方",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":670,
			"y":2980,
			"width":560,
			"height":80
		},
		{"id":"2e9e7b81f2630add","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260719213355.png","x":1536,"y":368,"width":400,"height":190},
		{"id":"265bd8331c14ae27","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/cfca20799ae6652dedcbb4f7596de4b6_720.jpg","x":494,"y":-1480,"width":593,"height":643},
		{"id":"18d41390a00133e4","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260720070235.png","x":2600,"y":-620,"width":399,"height":50},
		{
			"id":"00cfc6d03f4fcb5f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"微分方程只要给出就任意阶可导",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":2690,
			"y":-840,
			"width":300,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"5600a88cb8055915",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"$x, y$ 转换视角怎么看",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":2690,
			"y":-680,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"8bf3c20c9e6ec952","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428144238.png","x":1040,"y":368,"width":496,"height":166},
		{
			"id":"bcdc714d01114db3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(5) 全微分方程（后续多元积分会详细讲解）",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":1070,
			"y":134,
			"width":440,
			"height":74
		},
		{
			"id":"762c9b381dba3016",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"微分方程求解大观",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":660,
			"y":-620,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"8013b9a18e4367eb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**三角函数 × 多项式**不建议使用，比如：\n\n$$\nf(x) = x \\cdot \\sin x\n$$\n\n建议重新使用待定系数。",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":3560,
			"y":2330,
			"width":520,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"25a3e706c4cebdd8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[全微分方程](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1834y1X7v6/) ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":1100,
			"y":631,
			"width":380,
			"height":120
		},
		{"id":"a3c33cab4fcf8eaf","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260428005544.png","x":4476,"y":3683,"width":874,"height":297},
		{"id":"aea81592b4a0699f","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/result_48oK80.png","x":3080,"y":3794,"width":698,"height":280},
		{
			"id":"c3af8fcf4f370de7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"注例 6 是最复杂的",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":3886,
			"y":4160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"400c8c7bd80879b1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"注意点：\n\n1. 长除到**对应多项式的最高次数**\n2. 最后**可能还需要合并系数**（2010真题）",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":7000,
			"y":3474,
			"width":520,
			"height":199
		},
		{"id":"7cb37aec9371f839","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/result_yYzbN1.png","x":5972,"y":3970,"width":799,"height":564},
		{
			"id":"18c837aa20998eb7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"注意求导要添 $x$ ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":2435,
			"y":3840,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"e604d9d2ea4fcab3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"根据 $f(x)$ 的不同 —— **四种**类型",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":3640,
			"y":2610,
			"width":360,
			"height":160
		},
		{"id":"ddcd3cc5777e4fb6","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/result_xvG5v6.png","x":2240,"y":3326,"width":650,"height":387},
		{
			"id":"d65a629d6af04eb2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[微分算子法 - 吃尽天下面](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Qa411e7hf/) \n[微分算子法 - 李艳芳](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Gvgf6SEXb/)",
